{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1128035-your-mortal-merits","id":1128035,"title":"Your Mortal merits","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-12T07:01:15-07:00","id":1128035,"title":"Your Mortal merits","content":"You have to live in the Chronicles of Darkness, as a mere Vanilla mortal - no supernatural items, powers, allies. No microtemplate, no Hunter cell. You are pretty much part of Human: the Dying.<br /> <br /> To clarify: until this very moment, you have not had direct contact with the things that go bump, night or otherwise. Your Current job carries Over Into the ChroD. It is, for all intents and ourposes, you finding out right now that there is something in the shadows. What do you encounter? A Horror, vampire, Spirit, Beast, Ghost, Uratha, Fae?<br /> If you had a free choice of 10 + (Your age -18) Merit points (something you would like to have or have already, your choice, but nothing supernatural), what would you chose? Why?<br /> What is your likely goal?<br /> <br /> Example: I have 20 points to spend.<br /> I'd take common sense, since I like to think of myself as able to avoid stupid mistakes. Most of the time.<br /> Language (German), too, as that is one of my languages.<br /> Encyclopedic Knowledge (Occult), due to having had an interest in that stuff since forever.<br /> Library (Science)2 is something I'd like to get, and Sympathetic is something I believe applies to me. Also Chokehold, Clinch Strike and Iron skin 2 are things I believe apply to me.<br /> For my remaining four I would like to take Eidetic Memory And Eye for the Strange.<br /> With this, I would have a foundation with which to delve into the weirdness surrounding me, which would help in my goal to possibly join one of the splats or null misteriis, and make myself useful enough to possibly survive this craziness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8542,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","user":"Wormwood","date":".  giving me as an example 08-12-2017, 03:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T14:13:37-07:00","id":1128180,"title":"","content":"17 Merit Points (it would be 18 in two months, but whatev...)<br /> <br /> <b>Merits that already apply to me:</b><br /> <i>(3) Common Sense:</i> As someone whom everyone in my life looks to when they need grounding, I'd like to think this applies to me.<br /> <i>(2) Interdisciplinary Specialty:</i> Linguistics and Narratives. Actually true.<br /> <i>(1) Language:</i> Hebrew. Actually true.<br /> <i>(1) Tolerance For Biology:</i> Once, stuck on the road while the intersection I needed to get through was being cleared of a horrible accident, I watched firemen help a woman out of her smashed car a few yards away, and watched them realize that one of her feet was sliced almost clean off at the ankle. My first thought was, &quot;Huh. I wonder what in the car did that. Probably one of the peddles.&quot;<br /> <i>(2) Iron Will:</i> Same general reason as Common Sense and Tolerance for Biology. I'm not an easily moved person.<br /> <br /> <b>Merits I'd like to get with the remaining points:</b><br /> <i>(2) Indomitable</i><br /> <i>(3) Meditative Mind<br /> (3) Parkour</i><br /> <br /> I call it the Integrity build. Whatever supernatural I encounter, I won't start moaning about how my whole life has been a lie. The only splat I'd actually care to join is Sin-Eater, but regardless, I'd mostly like to survive and possibly gather supernatural resources/wealth. I could say I'd do something to make the world better, but honestly...long lost treasure, y'all.<br /> <br /> <b>For fun, Merits that I would be barred from ever taking:</b><br /> Direction Sense<br /> Small-Framed","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12708-chesh","name":"Chesh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12708_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T14:54:37-07:00","id":1128205,"title":"","content":"Resources 5 (Unfairly rich spouse)<br /> Status 5 (&quot;reality&quot; TV)<br /> Fame 3 (That one or two sex tape(s) that got leaked *wink, wink*)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T16:30:27-07:00","id":1128246,"title":"","content":"Eidetic Memory<br /> Language - Mandarin, Russian, Hebrew, Hindi, Arabic, Portuguese, French, German<br /> Meditative Mind 4<br /> Patient<br /> Resources 5<br /> Retainer 5<br /> Safe Place 4<br /> <br /> I'd probably just duck out of adventures, and with my new merits I'd likely be able to afford to. Plus languages because there's a lot of foreign literature I've always wanted to get into and my language teacher said I'd never be fluent as a native so now I can be. The others, Patient and Eidetic Memory, are vastly needed improvements.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T17:57:48-07:00","id":1128274,"title":"","content":"*misread thread. please ignore*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T02:03:12-07:00","id":1128365,"title":"","content":"So I'd have 10 points I'd have big for 6 dots because im big and I'd need help fir the rest","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13426-ameraaaaaa","name":"Ameraaaaaa","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title